# Elephants Dream remake — production design

The approved visual rules are in `design/bible.md`. Reference images are attached to the `design-reference-v1` release: `source-reference-stills-v1.zip` and two indexed survey contact sheets. The frozen film's pixels are for **reference only**, never for any finished shot. The opening title wall has a separate early lock in `design/opening-wall.md` and the `design-opening-v1` reference release. The director's `direction/shotlist.*` will define IDs for the per-shot design map; until then the bible's source time windows are provisional.

The director/editor-aligned 127-shot lookup is `design/shot-reference-index.csv`; release `design-shot-reference-v2` holds its source-only frame studies. The 131-shot v1 index/release is superseded.

The approved recurring Proog identity is `design/characters.md` and release `design-character-v1` (DP's newly painted portrait and a source/new comparison card). Emo's generated likeness awaits separate approval.
